CUSTOMER SITS
↓
WAITER APPROACHES TABLE
↓
WAITER OPENS MENU
↓
CUSTOMER SELECTS / RECEIVES MENU
↓
WAITER TAKES ORDER
↓
ORDER ITEMS ADDED
↓
ORDER VALIDATION
↓
