## Draft status

* OPEN
* EDITING
* READY_TO_CONFIRM
* CONFIRMED
* CANCELLED

Draft harus dapat diedit sebelum CONFIRMED.

### Draft operations

Implementasikan:

* Create draft.
* Add item.
* Remove item.
* Increase quantity.
* Decrease quantity.
* Set quantity.
* Edit notes.
* Recalculate total.
* Validate draft.
* Confirm draft.
* Cancel draft.

Rules:

* Quantity minimum 1.
* Quantity tidak boleh negatif.
* Menu item harus valid.
* Menu item harus available.
