# 10. ORDER STATUS STATE MACHINE

Implementasikan order status machine.

Minimal status:

* DRAFT
* CONFIRMED
* QUEUED
* ACCEPTED
* PREPARING
* READY
* SERVED
* COMPLETED
* CANCELLED

Phase 06 harus benar-benar mengimplementasikan:

* DRAFT
* CONFIRMED
* QUEUED
* ACCEPTED

Status PREPARING, READY, SERVED, dan COMPLETED harus disiapkan untuk integration dengan Phase 07/08, tetapi jangan menampilkan seolah-olah cooking atau delivery sudah berfungsi jika belum diimplementasikan.

## Valid transitions

DRAFT
↓
CONFIRMED
↓
QUEUED
↓
ACCEPTED
↓
PREPARING
↓
READY
↓
SERVED
↓
COMPLETED

CANCELLED hanya boleh dilakukan melalui aturan validasi.

Implementasikan transition guard.

Contoh:

* DRAFT → CONFIRMED: allowed.
* CONFIRMED → QUEUED: allowed.
* QUEUED → ACCEPTED: allowed.
* DRAFT → READY: forbidden.
* QUEUED → COMPLETED: forbidden.
* CANCELLED → PREPARING: forbidden.
* COMPLETED → QUEUED: forbidden.

Order state tidak boleh diubah langsung oleh UI.

Semua perubahan status harus melalui OrderService atau OrderStateMachine.

